flowchart TD
    U[Users and Internal Applications] --> WAF[Web Application Firewall - WAF]
    WAF --> GW[API Gateway]
    IDP[Identity Provider - OAuth2/OIDC and MFA] --> GW

    GW --> API1[API Service A - Health]
    GW --> API2[API Service B - Reports Summary]

    API1 --> DB[(Private Database)]
    API2 --> DB

    API2 --> AIP[Enterprise AI Proxy]
    AIP --> IG[Input Guardrails and Prompt Injection Checks]
    IG --> LLM[Approved Enterprise AI Provider]
    LLM --> OG[Output Guardrails and PII Checks]
    OG --> AIP
    AIP --> API2

    SEC[Secrets Manager] -. Credentials .-> API1
    SEC -. Credentials .-> API2
    SEC -. Provider Key .-> AIP

    WAF --> SIEM[Central SIEM and Security Monitoring]
    GW --> SIEM
    IDP --> SIEM
    API1 --> SIEM
    API2 --> SIEM
    AIP --> SIEM

    classDef security fill:#fce8e6,stroke:#b3261e,color:#222;
    classDef service fill:#e8f0fe,stroke:#174ea6,color:#222;
    classDef data fill:#e6f4ea,stroke:#137333,color:#222;

    class WAF,GW,IDP,AIP,IG,OG,SIEM security;
    class API1,API2,LLM,U service;
    class DB,SEC data;
